{"4098730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fowl Legacy 2: Heavenbound", "steam_appid": 4098730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You're in &quot;Heaven&quot; - But why?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricardo the chicken was sent to &quot;Heaven&quot; way too soon, and now he must find a way back to his world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore different landscapes</u></strong> to break Heavenly Chains, devices that open the Fare Well!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lighthouse in an ocean? A messy casino?? Who could be the mastermind here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/05f6d9e706b252b8f762779b87823527.poster.avif?t=1788212030\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/05f6d9e706b252b8f762779b87823527.webm?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/05f6d9e706b252b8f762779b87823527.mp4?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Use your familiar movement arsenal!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in Fowl Legacy, Ricardo can Jump, Ground Pound, and Dash! Could there possibly... be more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/2c59af5bc436796e01f2e3e90bd1b170.poster.avif?t=1788212030\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/2c59af5bc436796e01f2e3e90bd1b170.webm?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/2c59af5bc436796e01f2e3e90bd1b170.mp4?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Lots of awesome collectibles and secrets!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret Corbs, Gems, and... trading cards?? What could they be used for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/f55ac9ebd0186a1ac65b771972c64e99.poster.avif?t=1788212030\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/f55ac9ebd0186a1ac65b771972c64e99.webm?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/f55ac9ebd0186a1ac65b771972c64e99.mp4?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Better combat? Of course!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricardo can guard AND parry enemies?! (And air dodge too?!?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/d93c90f9008c69c81abbc7b5156535c2.poster.avif?t=1788212030\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/d93c90f9008c69c81abbc7b5156535c2.webm?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/d93c90f9008c69c81abbc7b5156535c2.mp4?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Watch out! Heaven fights back!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New threats in every environment, each of them tougher than the last. Figure them out to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/a1ced999e570d7a977dee003c58d0842.poster.avif?t=1788212030\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/a1ced999e570d7a977dee003c58d0842.webm?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098730/extras/a1ced999e570d7a977dee003c58d0842.mp4?t=1788212030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Beware the Sleepwalkers...?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar Sleepwalker may be seen in &quot;Heaven,&quot; along with some other mysterious ones... what are they preparing for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate, and maybe <strong><i>a new power will be discovered...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you persevere and take down whoever imprisoned Ricardo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then grab your Chicken Sword and slash your way to victory!</p>